<title>USA: Fila Holdings SpA Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>Fila Holdings SpA Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>FILA HOLDING S.p.A.</p>
<p>			 Consolidated Statements of Income</p>
<p>			  For The Three Months  For The Nine Months</p>
<p>			     Ended September 30  Ended September 30</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Lire, except for earnings per share)</p>
<p>				 1996	1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p> Total revs		611,097  435,106  1,645,716  1,120,629</p>
<p>Income before</p>
<p>  incomes taxes	  100,802   56,305    234,999    124,354</p>
<p> Income taxes	     35,770   19,585     84,886     43,263</p>
<p> Net income		 65,032   36,720    150,113     81,091</p>
<p>Earnings per</p>
<p>  share (in Lire)	    491	294	1,133	  649</p>
<p>NOTE: Earnings per share have been calculated by dividing net income by 132,500,000 and 125,000,000 ordinary shares outstanding for the three months ended September 30, 1996 and 1995 and the nine months ended September 30, 1996 and 1995, respectively.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
